I have found an interesting way of making holy water in NH3 pl 9  which i
don't think has been covered here before. 

This discovered this bug/spoiler by an accident. I had two ordinary potions
of gain ability. I thought i would dip one in my holy water to get as blessed
one. It turned out that both potions became blessed. OK this far nothing new
under the sun.

Then i had to try with my two potions of water, and voila i got two potions
of holy water by sacrificing  one. It should work with several so that you should
be able to get lets say four potions of holy water by carificing one. A realy
good way to get holy water. No altars needed. Your alignment is irrelevant.

So all you need now to make holy water is a wand of cancelation and one (1)
potion of holy water and some "bad" potions to cancel.

